  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Financement nouveau JPO &quot;Resilience Officer&quot; aupr&#xE8;s IOM &#xE0; Bamako, Mali (Programme 2020 - Recrutement 2021)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Junior Professional Officers Programme 2020 -  JPO &quot;Resilience Officer&quot; for IOM in Mali Bamako (programme 2020 - Recruitment 2021) _ reassignment to Benin for third year</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPO Programme recruits Junior Professional Officers for the different UN Organisations. JPOs are recruited under bilateral agreements between the UN and donor countries. JPOs are generally nationals of donor countries. Belgium also finances nationals of developing countries. Candidates are 32 years old with a Master degree and minimum two years of professional experience.</narrative>
  </description>
